      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bakazi muhulire bashaija banyu. Ka haraba haliho abatalikwikiliza kigambo kya Ruhanga, bashobore kuhindurwa emirolere ya bakazi babo bataina kigambo kyona kyona ekyo babagambire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orwo barabona emirolere yanyu emirungi eshemeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwechuma kwanyu okw'emibili kutagiramu kusiba ishoke, okwelengya n'ezahabu n'okujwara ebishemeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwechuma kwanyu kube kw'omunda aha mitima, ekijwaro ekitafa eky'eibare ly'eiguzi eky'omwoyo gw'obufura n'obuchulezi, ekirungi muno ahali Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo n'eirai abakazi batakatifu abamanyaga Ruhanga n'okuhulira baibabo bajwaraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obulebero ni Sara; yahuliraga Aburahamu namweta “Mukama wange.” Leba mbwenu inywe muli baana ba Sara kamurata nimukorage mutalikusindikwa butini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nainywe bashaija muture mutyo na bakazi banyu. Mukunire omukazi aha rw'okuba amanige gake kushaaga ag'omushaija, nobona inywe hamoi na bonene nimwija kugilirwa ekisha ekilibagiza oburora, enshara zanyu zitaliija zikakwatira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eky'enzindo inywena mugire emitekelereze emoi, mushasirangane, mugonzangane bundi barumuna, mugilirangane embabazi n'omutima gw'obuchulezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke kwehorozangana anga omuntu kukujuma naiwe okamujuma. Omu mwanya gw'ebyo mwenderangane omugisha, manya ogwo nigwo mweto gwanyu, nirwo mulibona kutungwa omugisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manyasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
